!                                                                                                   
! Calculation of molecular oxygen using the (0,2) sector of Fock space                              
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Molecular nitrogen. Ground and excited states (X, a, b).                                            
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.ANALYZE                                                                                            
**GENERAL                                                                                           
.CVALUE                                                                                             
50.0d0                                                                                              
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACTED                                                                                       
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.DOSSSS                                                                                             
.X2C                                                                                                
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.RELCCSD                                                                                            
*SCF                                                                                                
! O2_2+ closed shell reference                                                                      
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
 6 8                                                                                                
#.EVCCNV                                                                                            
#1.E-10 1.E-9                                                                                       
**ANALYZE                                                                                           
.MULPOP                                                                                             
*MULPOP                                                                                             
.VECPOP                                                                                             
all                                                                                                 
all                                                                                                 
**RELCCSD                                                                                           
.NELEC                                                                                              
 2 2 3 3                                                                                            
.FOCKSP                                                                                             
*CCFSPC                                                                                             
.DOEA                                                                                               
.NACTP                                                                                              
 2 2 0 0                                                                                            
.DOIE                                                                                               
.NACTH                                                                                              
 0 0 2 2                                                                                            
.DOEXC                                                                                              
.MAXIT                                                                                              
100                                                                                                 
*END OF                                                                                             


